{"id":"wdtw","title":"Weighted dynamic time warping","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Weighted DTW changes the price of a match according to its displacement from the diagonal. The local squared discrepancy is multiplied by a logistic weight that increases with displacement. The animation then optimizes those weighted costs and displays the resulting path, without imposing a hard band.","intro_zh":"加权 DTW 根据匹配位置偏离对角线的程度改变代价。局部平方误差乘以随位移增加的逻辑函数权重，再对这些加权代价求最优路径。本例不施加硬窗口。","steps_en":["Choose raw observations and any neighborhood descriptor.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["选择原始观测以及需要的邻域描述符。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"w(k)=1/(1+exp(-0.6*(k-L/2))); d=sqrt(min_path sum w(|i-j|)*(x_i-y_j)^2)","caveats_en":["These weights are at most one: the penalty is relative across displacements, not an added nonnegative surcharge to ordinary DTW.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["这里的权重不超过一；所谓惩罚表示不同位移之间的相对权重，不是给普通 DTW 额外增加非负费用。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"aeon: logistic weighted DTW","url":"https://www.aeon-toolkit.org/en/stable/api_reference/auto_generated/aeon.distances.wdtw_distance.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none","weighted":true,"g":0.6},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.12037329396424752,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.0004742587317756679,0.0008317269649392233,0.012766595841043903,0.23147521650098238,2.041019676139418,4.205,2.8473443104557568,0.6225050746342045,0.0,0.22920682587651942],[0.007485542684453016,0.00047425873177566814,0.0008317269649392233,0.0907846815363122,1.120340047864755,2.5831655276139514,1.805,0.3163715900506398,0.030740991339960708,0.42049297819876097],[0.14185106490048782,0.053230525756110335,0.017073314343924045,0.0008317269649392216,0.3191648960260976,0.9259008660039295,0.5102549190348543,0.0,0.5229816080428944,1.5063085756580747],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"row_label":"x index","col_label":"y index","cursor":[2,0]}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Compare samples to construct the local table","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Local comparison costs","z":[[0.0004742587317756679,0.0008317269649392233,0.012766595841043903,0.23147521650098238,2.041019676139418,4.205,2.8473443104557568,0.6225050746342045,0.0,0.22920682587651942],[0.007485542684453016,0.00047425873177566814,0.0008317269649392233,0.0907846815363122,1.120340047864755,2.5831655276139514,1.805,0.3163715900506398,0.030740991339960708,0.42049297819876097],[0.14185106490048782,0.053230525756110335,0.017073314343924045,0.0008317269649392216,0.3191648960260976,0.9259008660039295,0.5102549190348543,0.0,0.5229816080428944,1.5063085756580747],[1.2245038952901965,0.6255631962111513,0.3002534343430598,0.06